        "message": "The first deformable fit now reproduces the lower-lung vascular tree well: the mapped inhale surface passes through the same branch junctions at q05\u2013q08. The two upper peripheral points are more sensitive to deformation-grid resolution, so I\u2019m refining with a local neighborhood-correlation stage and will inspect those landmarks in orthogonal 3D views before writing the answer."
